    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strange wish fulfilling entity has appeared on the edge of the universe. You and your team pilot a combined MEKA to get to it, but you're not the only ones there...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/7f015ff7348d0f25cef1ba9702bf716a.poster.avif?t=1740154234\" width=708 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/7f015ff7348d0f25cef1ba9702bf716a.webm?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/7f015ff7348d0f25cef1ba9702bf716a.mp4?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> <br>You will have to fight your way through a sequence of bosses just to get a shot at getting your wishes granted. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  <br>In-between the fights you can spend time with your team, get to know them better and improve their performance with gifts and special items.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/b25ddf56ca6a290b7ce85cc022f1940d.poster.avif?t=1740154234\" width=638 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/b25ddf56ca6a290b7ce85cc022f1940d.webm?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/b25ddf56ca6a290b7ce85cc022f1940d.mp4?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>They've all put their trust in you. Do your best.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strange wish fulfilling entity has appeared on the edge of the universe. You and your team pilot a combined MEKA to get to it, but you're not the only ones there...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/7f015ff7348d0f25cef1ba9702bf716a.poster.avif?t=1740154234\" width=708 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/7f015ff7348d0f25cef1ba9702bf716a.webm?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/7f015ff7348d0f25cef1ba9702bf716a.mp4?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> <br>You will have to fight your way through a sequence of bosses just to get a shot at getting your wishes granted. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  <br>In-between the fights you can spend time with your team, get to know them better and improve their performance with gifts and special items.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/b25ddf56ca6a290b7ce85cc022f1940d.poster.avif?t=1740154234\" width=638 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/b25ddf56ca6a290b7ce85cc022f1940d.webm?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450750/extras/b25ddf56ca6a290b7ce85cc022f1940d.mp4?t=1740154234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>They've all put their trust in you. Do your best.</strong></h2>",
